# Stock clang-format preset, no bespoke overrides.
#
# "Microsoft" is one of clang-format's built-in styles and matches the toolchain
# we build with. Run `clang-format --style=Microsoft --dump-config` to see every
# value it implies. Deliberately one line: a style nobody has to argue about is
# worth more than one tuned to current habits.
BasedOnStyle: Microsoft
